                  "timestamp": 1792042227217,
                  "result": {
                    "tool": "mem0_search",
                    "success": true,
                    "policy_blocked": false,
                    "text": "{\"results\": [{\"id\": \"81c9b99a-5c8d-441e-ae76-3ba079d83440\", \"memory\": \"User, Jen, and Alex in the 'Park pals' group planned a walk at 2pm on Friday, October 16, 2026 at the west entrance of the duck pond in Willow Park, with Jen proposing on October 12, 2026 and both Alex and User agreeing.\", \"score\": 0.8981842068861133}, {\"id\": \"12c0bffe-8b72-4ef8-a372-6c75210ba16c\", \"memory\": \"User, Jen, and Alex in the 'Park pals' group postponed their Friday plan on October 14, 2026 after Jen said she couldn't make it Friday and Alex said he also couldn't make it because the week got hectic, with User agreeing to postpone to another day.\", \"score\": 0.8283045157910522}, {\"id\": \"ae4e2d33-ce60-469b-b9b6-e1611a33966e\", \"memory\": \"User and Maya discussed trying a new pizza place near the station on September 27, 2026, with Maya suggesting they try it sometime and User noting they had walked past it the other day and agreeing it could be good for their next pizza craving\", \"score\": 0.6929821860238751}, {\"id\": \"9dd02857-7036-40d0-99eb-7ad6c33afce3\", \"memory\": \"Jen's umbrella broke during her walk to work on the morning of September 25, 2026 when wind flipped it inside out and snapped one of the spokes, leaving her a little damp as she was almost at the office\", \"score\": 0.6542033023530063}, {\"id\": \"b4bb26b8-1bf1-4085-9faf-d56237dcb70f\", \"memory\": \"User, Maya, and Leo in the 'Friday crew' group rescheduled their pizza at Mario's on Pine Street on Friday, September 25, 2026 from noon to 1pm, after Maya requested the change on September 24, 2026 due to a morning appointment, with User and Leo both agreeing to the new time.\", \"score\": 0.37027144451866734}, {\"id\": \"a500a8bb-29f0-4cad-b33b-0754d3d4685a\", \"memory\": \"User agreed on October 13, 2026 to help Jen review her nearly finished job application with a second pair of eyes on a quick call at 10am on Friday morning, October 16, 2026, with User asking Jen to send the application beforehand.\", \"score\": 0.3310809861775573}, {\"id\": \"74215fe8-f10d-4957-8b19-0d1cb1998699\", \"memory\": \"User and Alex planned to grab coffee at 11am on Friday, October 16, 2026 at Birch, with Alex proposing the meetup on October 13, 2026 and User agreeing that morning works and confirming.\", \"score\": 0.30534711660207164}, {\"id\": \"5cac179d-1f9d-4433-91bb-f4561a019126\", \"memory\": \"Alex bought a tiny basil plant with about 3 little leaves in a shot-sized pot on September 20, 2026, sharing a photo with keys for scale. Alex described it as small but mighty and already smelling amazing, while User jokingly replied there is more basil on a slice of pizza and wished Alex enjoyment of one leaf of pesto.\", \"score\": 0.29365423376719946}, {\"id\": \"8766bd58-7f11-4a0e-ade9-2cd515c113e9\", \"memory\": \"Alex's tiny basil plant had grown enough to use by September 29, 2026, up from about 3 little leaves in a shot-sized pot when bought on September 20, 2026.\", \"score\": 0.2837479423203729}, {\"id\": \"377ab4be-a848-4f4c-8b41-97b97767daf2\", \"memory\": \"Alex joked on October 7, 2026 that if he ever wins the lottery he would rent out Mario's every Saturday to offer free pizza for everyone, and User responded enthusiastically that User would be down for fantasy free pizza every week\", \"score\": 0.27935137052651887}], \"count\": 10}",
